<title>UK: FEK sets 1.0 bln rand 20-year zero coupon bond.</title>
<headline>FEK sets 1.0 bln rand 20-year zero coupon bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FINNISH EXPORT CREDIT</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN RAND  COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    04.AUG.17</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  8.115     PAY DATE    04.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.50	LISTING    LONDON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA    DENOMS (M) 5-50-500</p>
<p>SALE LIMITS US/UK/SA/FI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  FINLAND   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.25	PRAECIPUUM  0.1</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
